  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For lead storage battery pick the correct statements</p><p>A. During charging of battery, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> on anode is converted into&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>B. During charging of battery, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> on cathode is converted into <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>C. Lead storage battery consists of grid of lead packed with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> as anode</p><p>D. Lead storage battery has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>%</mo></math> solution of sulphuric acid as an electrolyte</p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "MioI0",
      "text": "A, B, D only",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "vTGV7",
      "text": "B, C, D only",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ab9FB",
      "text": "B, C only",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "hUwxm",
      "text": "B, D only",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/18de95a8-5296-4e61-b37b-00995ee55864.png\" style=\"width: 319px; height: 208px;\" /></p><p>The lead storage battery is as shown in diagram. Lead storage battery consists of&nbsp;lead anode and&nbsp;a grid of lead packed with lead oxide(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>)&nbsp;as cathode,&nbsp;a&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>38</mn><mo>%</mo></math>&nbsp;solution of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;used as an electrolyte.&nbsp;During charging of battery <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> deposited on cathode is converted in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PbSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> deposited on anode is converted into <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Pb</mi></math>. The electrolyte used in battery is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> which is about <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>38</mn><mo>%</mo></math> by mass.&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
